# Generated pages are written with LF and nothing converts them. Pinning the
# checkout stops a Windows clone from turning every line into a change the
# next time the Linux runner rebuilds — which is exactly what the first real
# Action run did: 2,963 insertions and 2,963 deletions, none of them content.
*.html text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
